- **From the Paladin Class Table:** a proficiency bonus of +6, a Sacred Oath Feature, and spell slots (4 1st-level, 3 2nd-level, 3 3rd-level, 3 4th-level, 2 5th-level).
- **From the Sacred Oath descriptions:**
  - **Oath of Devotion:** the Holy Nimbus feature (action to emanate a 30-foot bright light aura for 1 minute; hostile creatures starting their turn in bright light take 10 radiant damage; advantage on saving throws against spells from fiends and undead; once per long rest).
  - **Oath of the Ancients:** the Elder Champion feature (action to transform for 1 minute; regain 10 hit points at start of each turn; cast paladin spells with casting time of 1 action as a bonus action; enemies within 10 feet have disadvantage on saving throws against paladin spells and Channel Divinity; once per long rest).
  - **Oath of Vengeance:** the Avenging Angel feature (action to transform for 1 hour; gain 60 ft flying speed; emanate a 30-foot aura of menace causing enemies to make Wisdom save or be frightened; attack rolls against frightened creatures have advantage; once per long rest).

